From d08b54da276102c2b607fbddd07966111f5147cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hao Lin <hao.lin@samsung.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 19:08:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Guard BOLT task plans, cleanup and ELF properties

Accept only the certified BOLT build tasks and paired TF configuration
refresh, then verify real tasks and preserve the prebuilt TF archive.
Fail closed on process cleanup, response files, package traversal and
expanded ELF security attributes. Print the plan and pipeline anchors.

Quickbuild cannot change project configuration or build arguments, so
x86_64 keeps clang_bolt enabled by default. To disable it in Quickbuild,
submit a spec change from bcond_without to bcond_with clang_bolt.
Local --without clang_bolt matches baseline build/install expansion.

Candidate generation parameters and profile are unchanged.

Signed-off-by: Hao Lin <hao.lin@samsung.com>
---
 packaging/clang-bolt-helper.py | 286 ++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 packaging/llvm.spec            |  31 +++-
 2 files changed, 240 insertions(+), 77 deletions(-)

